{
  "id": "10122_utsusu",
  "headword": "{移|うつ}す",
  "reading": "うつす",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to move; to transfer",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to move; to transfer; to shift",
      "explanation": "To move something from one place to another. The transitive counterpart to 移る (to move/change)."
    },
    {
      "sense_number": 2,
      "gloss": "to infect; to pass on (disease)",
      "explanation": "To transmit an illness or disease to another person."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "10122_utsusu_ex1",
      "japanese": "{箱|はこ}の{中身|なかみ}を{別|べつ}の{箱|はこ}に{移|うつ}した。",
      "english": "I moved the contents of the box to another box.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "10122_utsusu_ex2",
      "japanese": "{本社|ほんしゃ}を{東京|とうきょう}に{移|うつ}す。",
      "english": "We will move the headquarters to Tokyo.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "10122_utsusu_ex3",
      "japanese": "{風邪|かぜ}を{人|ひと}に{移|うつ}さないように{気|き}をつける。",
      "english": "I'm careful not to pass my cold on to others.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: Transitive ({他動詞|たどうし}). The intransitive pair is {移|うつ}る.\n\nASPECT: {移|うつ}している indicates ongoing action of moving/transferring.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・Xを〜に{移|うつ}す (to move X to ~)\n・{視線|しせん}を{移|うつ}す (to shift one's gaze)\n・{風邪|かぜ}を{移|うつ}す (to pass on a cold)\n\nPAIR VERB:\n・{移|うつ}る (intransitive - to move, to change)",
